{"annotations":{"audience":["assistant"],"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Search cadastral parcels by cadastral reference: municipality (fuzzy match), sheet number (foglio), parcel label, optional section. Returns matching parcels with FID, municipality, sheet, area and centroid.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"comune":{"description":"Municipality name, required. Example: \"Roma\"","type":"string"},"foglio":{"description":"Cadastral sheet number. Example: \"481\"","type":"string"},"label":{"description":"Parcel label. Example: \"A\" or \"123\"","type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"Max results, default 20","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"sezione":{"description":"Administrative section. Example: \"A\"","type":"string"}},"required":["comune"],"type":"object"},"name":"zornade_parcel_search","title":"Search parcels by cadastral reference"}
